### Leave Management API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Create Leave Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "startDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2024-02-05T00:00:00.000Z",
  "type": "vacation",
  "reason": "Family vacation"
}

### 2. Get All Leaves (HR Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves?page=1&rows=10

### 3. Get Leaves by Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/employee/1?page=1&rows=10

### 4. Get Leave by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1

### 5. Get Leave Types
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/types

### 6. Get Leave Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/balance/1?year=2024

### 7. Approve Leave Request (HR Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approved"
}

### 8. Decline Leave Request (HR Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "rejected"
}

### 9. Cancel Leave Request
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/leaves/1

###############################################
### Exit Management API Tests
###############################################

### 1. Create Exit Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/exits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "exitType": "resignation",
  "exitDate": "2024-03-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Better opportunity"
}

### 2. Get All Exits (HR Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exits?page=1&rows=10

### 3. Get Exits by Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/exits/employee/1?page=1&rows=10

### 4. Get Exit by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/exits/1

### 5. Approve Exit Request (HR Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/exits/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approved"
}

### 6. Reject Exit Request (HR Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/exits/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "rejected"
}
